Component architectures, token definitions (e.g. SheetBottomTokens,
AppBarTokens, ToolbarTokens, MotionScheme, SpringPhysics), interaction states,
and API surfaces in this library are adapted from the official AndroidX
Compose Material 3 Kotlin implementation.

Loading indicator cubic geometry and morph pairs are generated from AndroidX
graphics-shapes (RoundedPolygon, Morph and their helpers), MaterialShapes.kt,
and LoadingIndicator.kt at revision a095da93f8e98dea8748ceed79ea8427aade245f.
