The generator substitutes minimal Compose geometry adapters for standalone JVM
execution; the browser interpolates exported cubic pairs and renders them on Canvas.
See tools/androidx-shapes for the reproducible generator and source hash manifest.
The canonical SVG shape catalog in src/tokens/shapes.js is generated from the
same normalized MaterialShapes polygons. Legacy hexagon remains a web extension.

